@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 90

actor "Benutzer / Entwickler" as User

rectangle "Digital Twin System\n(Python API)" as DTS
rectangle "Unity Simulation\n(3D & Physik)" as Unity
rectangle "MyPalletizer 260 M5\n(Hardware)" as Hardware

User -right-> DTS : Steuerbefehle
DTS -right-> Unity : Befehle zur Simulation
DTS -down-> Hardware : Befehle zur Hardware
Hardware .up.> DTS : Ist-Winkel
Unity .down.> User : Visuelles Feedback
Hardware .left.> User : Physische Bewegung

@enduml